The biggest lesson from this optimization was that cost optimization is not about choosing the cheapest technology. It's about choosing the right compute model for the workload. Since our ETL platform was heavily SQL-driven, moving from Job Clusters to SQL Warehouse allowed us to leverage Photon, improve utilization, reduce startup overhead, and significantly lower our Databricks costs.

